Anon Aadhaar real-proof fixture

fixture.json in this directory holds one Groth16 proof generated for this repository. It was
made with software and test data from Anon Aadhaar:

  repository: https://github.com/anon-aadhaar/anon-aadhaar
  commit:     4dad918761cfb1d7d5ed9918dcd796d0cb23ae82
  inputs:     packages/circuits/assets/dataInput.json (testQRData)
              packages/circuits/assets/testCertificate.pem
  packages:   @anon-aadhaar/core 2.4.3 (npm)
  artifacts:  v2.0.0 aadhaar-verifier.wasm, circuit_final.zkey and vkey.json from
              https://anon-aadhaar-artifacts.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/v2.0.0/

No upstream file is copied into this directory. The test QR data is a sample identity that
upstream re-signed with its published test key; the proof proves that identity under that key.

